{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "SLO-1 API availability (5m)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ma3:slo1:success_rate:5m",
          "legendFormat": "success",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.99 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.995 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "SLO-1 error budget remaining (30d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ma3:slo1:error_budget_remaining:30d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "SLO-2 scrape up (5m avg)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ma3:slo2:up:5m",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.995 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "SLO-3 ma3_context p95 (5m)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ma3:slo3:context_p95:5m",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "HTTP request rate by status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(ma3_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "MCP tool call rate by tool/outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (tool, outcome) (rate(ma3_mcp_tool_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "ma3_context latency percentiles",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(ma3_mcp_tool_duration_seconds_bucket{tool=\"ma3_context\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(ma3_mcp_tool_duration_seconds_bucket{tool=\"ma3_context\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(ma3_mcp_tool_duration_seconds_bucket{tool=\"ma3_context\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ma3-prom" }
    },
    {
      "title": "Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Internal SLOs (not a public SLA)**\n\n- SLO-1 target ≥ 99.5% non-5xx on `/mcp`, `/healthz`, `/api/*` (30d)\n- SLO-2 external reachability is measured by the **off-host probe on host 202**; this panel shows scrape `up` as a secondary signal\n- SLO-3 `ma3_context` p95 ≤ 2.5s (30d)\n\nPrometheus: `127.0.0.1:9090` · Alertmanager: `127.0.0.1:9093` · Grafana: `127.0.0.1:3000`"
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["ma3", "slo"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "ma3 SLO overview",
  "uid": "ma3-slo",
  "version": 1
}
